        "y0": 601.92,
        "x1": 231.84799999999998,
        "y1": 615.12,
        "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Each party grants to the other a non-exclusive easement for ingress and egress over the Access Drives shown on Exhibit B.",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 583.92,
        "x1": 553.6,
        "y1": 595.92,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "The easements are appurtenant and shall run with the land.",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 559.62,
        "x1": 296.15000000000003,
        "y1": 571.62,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "SHARED PARKING",
        "x0": 54.0,
        "y0": 535.32,
        "x1": 154.221,
        "y1": 548.5200000000001,
        "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Parking areas shown on the Site Plan shall be shared. No party shall materially impair access to or use of shared parking.",
